<Resource id="override_field" type="field_map">
    <!--
    V5RC Override 2026-2027 nominal field geometry.

    Field frame, viewed from the Audience View:
      origin        = inside bottom-left of the 3566.4 mm nominal field
      +x            = right
      +y            = toward the top / 0-degree wall in the VEX drawing
      +z            = up
      planar angle  = counterclockwise from +x

    Landmark origins are the plan-view centers of the goals projected onto
    the field floor. Every landmark frame is aligned with the field frame,
    so every NominalPose heading is zero. Tag surface frames use +x as the
    outward surface normal and +z as the decoded printed top.

    Geometry is derived from the official 2026-04-26 STEP and remains
    provisional until checked against physical field elements. The
    tagCircle21h7 detection size is the detector-corner edge, not the
    carrier plate or outer printed graphic.
    -->

